    "gp_section_520890175555896128": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "9bb1b15f8a23375c3b57a5d708a2fab191d005ba62179febfd7ce288a6bff68d_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg-EKLzX7Fg_text": "WORTH EVERY PENNY",
        "gg2oATCA8UC_text": "Kelly F.",
        "gg4xFFoLF7W_text": "<p>“This Shilajit has transformed my daily routine. Highly Effective!</p>",
        "gg6a9NUHIkt_text": "<p>Grace L.</p>",
        "ggBDkZawzF4_text": "<p>“Absolutely LOVE IT! Worth Every PENNY”</p>",
        "ggCoNNWF5Lg_text": "<p>For the last 10 years, I've focused on eating only natural foods—no dairy, grains, processed, or fast foods. Recently, I added supplements to my regimen, and shilajit has become a staple. I take it in the morning with my Matcha tea, turmeric, mushroom blend, flaxseed oil, and sea moss with burdock root and bladderwrack.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit has been worth the investment, even though it's one of the pricier options. I noticed a difference within four or five days of my morning and night routine. I don't feel sluggish or need caffeine for energy. Instead, I feel relaxed, stress-free, and energetic, waking up ready to go. I use the included spoon to measure my serving, let the resin dissolve in my mouth, and then swallow it with water. The taste is very earthy, like placing a rock or dirt in your mouth, but it's worth it!</p>",
        "ggE7sBEkLLi_text": "<p>John M.</p>",
        "ggF7X_0YtNI_text": "<span style=\"color:#122E0D;\">What customers said about</span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\">Shilajit Essential Extract</span>",
        "ggNGcANvfIe_text": "<p>I've been taking this supplement for two weeks, and the results are excellent. I no longer feel sluggish or need caffeine for energy. Instead, I feel relaxed, stress-free, and energetic, waking up ready to go. I measure my serving with the included spoon, let it dissolve in my mouth, and then swallow it with water. The taste is earthy, but it doesn't bother me. I had blood work done before starting the supplement and will compare results after a month. Based on my experience, I recommend this product for a natural energy boost. After a month, my testosterone levels increased from 152 to 438. I feel focused, stress-free, and energized. The product has worked wonders for me, and I stand by my purchase.</p>",
        "ggPnXFVsVW-_text": "INCREDIBLE RESULTS",
        "ggSNM6WwmgZ_text": "<p>“Can't believe how well this works. Feeling Great!”</p>",
        "ggXzHT75I_F_text": "<p>I've been using this product for a month. It's expensive, but worth it. Shilajit resin was recommended for natural energy and focus. Other supplements either don't work for me or disrupt my sleep. Despite my doubts, I chose the purest, most highly rated brand and I'm glad I did. It took some time, but I noticed sustained energy and focus throughout the day. Unlike other supplements, this one doesn't fall flat midday. Even after a month, I haven't experienced diminishing returns. I'll continue using this effective product!</p>",
        "ggamJr_GoSl_text": "TOP-NOTCH QUALITY",
        "ggecgzMTTRp_text": "Karen M.⁩",
        "ggnc3vESAWh_text": "Brian L.",
        "ggtDOY-P1yO_text": "<p>“This Is The Best Shilajit Out There. Highly Recommend!”</p>",
        "ggvate9gPAY_text": "BEST SUPPLEMENT",
        "ggxUCo35Ciu_text": "<p>John M.</p>",
        "ggz151dBcWS_text": "<p>Linda K.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-520890175555896128"
    },
